<!--Post: 13453--><!--Time: 1115320743-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13453"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Affie4u<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Affie4u<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, May 05, 2005 - 12:19 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Did dennis rader actaully look at stevie or charlie or danny or carmen or any other family members at court yesterday ?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13453-->
<!--Post: 13500--><!--Time: 1115402347-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13500"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lostdog<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lostdog<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, May 06, 2005 - 10:59 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->From the KC Star: <BR> <BR>Steve Relford...said Wednesday that he made brief eye contact with Rader in the courtroom. <BR> <BR>&#34;I really can&#39;t make a statement about how I felt because it might get me in trouble.&#34; <BR> <BR>&#34;&#40;if I had acted on my feelings&#41;I&#39;d be sitting where he is right now.&#34; <BR> <BR>&#34;I expected some psycho-looking dude, He looked very upstanding and respectable.&#34; <BR> <BR>&#34;It was very difficult to just sit there and not do nothing... I just wanted to jump up and rip his damn head off. It was very difficult.&#34; <BR> <BR>The article goes on to state that Danny O. was the one who prophesized aloud to Rader -- and that Nola Foulston facilitated Charlie&#39;s trip to Wichita through correspondence with the New Mexico parole board. <BR> <BR>Right on Nola! <BR> <BR>I expect that all the living victims will have an opportunity to make eye contact with BTK at the sentencing hearing. <BR> <BR>Professor Phoenix… you out there? I have questions. <BR> <BR>While I wonder if the prosecution would dare call Steve Relford to testify, he will be given the opportunity to face Rader prior to sentencing, right? <BR> <BR>Are surviving victims given coaching by prosecutors in advance of their face-off at the sentencing hearing? <BR> <BR>Poor Steve needs a lot of help -- but that one day, will carry so much weight for him. <BR>I hope he gets the assistance he needs to prepare mentally and emotionally. <BR> <BR>LD <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13500-->
<!--Post: 13504--><!--Time: 1115405795-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13504"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Phoenix<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Phoenix<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->3-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, May 06, 2005 - 11:56 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->LD: <BR> <BR>Kansas has a victims bill of rights which gives them the right to address the defendant at sentencing.  They will get to speak directly to him if he&#39;s convicted. <BR> <BR>Phoenix<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13504-->
<!--Post: 13520--><!--Time: 1115441533-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13520"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Phoenix<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Phoenix<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->3-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, May 06, 2005 - 9:52 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->lupuslost: <BR> <BR>The DA has a victim/witness division that assists in these matters.  This is the link to the DA&#39;s website.  <a href="http://www.sedgwickcounty.org/da/" target=_top>http://www.sedgwickcounty.org/da/</a> <BR> <BR>Phoenix<!--/Text--></td></tr>
